# Nothing is ignored here on purpose.
#
# The forms were gitignored at first, on the reasoning that manifest.tsv
# records every URL so they can be re-fetched. That reasoning is wrong: state
# revenue departments rotate form URLs every filing season, so within a year
# the manifest would be a list of 404s and the material would be gone again.
# These are primary sources the rules are derived from and audited against.
# They are committed.
